Tool response:
Tool: find_pharmacy_by_location
Description: Retrieve the ID of a pharmacy based on its street address, city, and state.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "street_address": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Street address of the pharmacy",
          "title": "Street Address"
        },
        "city": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "City where the pharmacy is located",
          "title": "City"
        },
        "state": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "State where the pharmacy is located",
          "title": "State"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "street_address",
        "city",
        "state"
      ]
    }

Tool response:
Tool: find_service_by_name
Description: Retrieve the ID of the 'Flu Vaccination' service to ensure it is correctly referenced when booking an appointment.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "name": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Name of the service to find",
          "title": "Name"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "name"
      ]
    }

Tool response:
Tool: schedule_flu_vaccination
Description: Book a flu vaccination appointment at a specific CVS Pharmacy location for a specified date and time window.
The appointment must be scheduled for the 'Flu Vaccination' service and within the requested timeframe.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "user_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "User Id"
        },
        "pharmacy_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Pharmacy Id"
        },
        "service_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Service Id"
        },
        "appointment_date": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "Appointment Date"
        },
        "start_time": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "Start Time"
        },
        "end_time": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "End Time"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "user_id",
        "pharmacy_id",
        "service_id",
        "appointment_date",
        "start_time",
        "end_time"
      ]
    }
